# Vendored Samuel-pipeline directory. The largest reference assets are kept
# out of git; they live at /var/home/aoz/data/wb-temp-attr-projections/from-samuel/
# and are symlinked into place here (no trailing slash on those rules, since
# `dir/` does not match a symlink). The pipeline reads from `data/erf/`,
# `data/tmrel/`, `data/mortality/` etc. (some are symlinks back into this
# directory).

# Raw DANE death-certificate archives (~1.25 GB total)
*.zip

# Burkart 2021 ERF curve samples (~130 MB each, 17 files)
Info Burkart/ERF

# Duplicates of curve samples that live at the Info Burkart/ top level
Info Burkart/*_curve_samples.csv

# Burkart 2021 Lancet supplementary mmc1 PDF (96 MB) — we have the smaller
# 2021_GBDtemp_anexos.pdf which covers the same methodology
Info Burkart/mmc1.pdf

# TMREL collection (~97 MB, 1,034 locations x 2 files each) — already
# symlinked into data/tmrel/ which is what the pipeline reads
Info Burkart/TMRELs

# Samuel's Colombia result PDFs (~50 MB)
results
